tests {
  test('status is successful', function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.be.oneOf([200]);
  });
}

docs {
  Locations, interests, behaviours and income brackets as Meta names them, for the `targeting` block of an ad. `income` ignores `q`.

  Requires the `ads` scope when using an API key.

  **Scope:** `ads`
}
